      "abstract_snippet": "Research on trust in AI is limited to several trustors (e.g., end-users) and trustees (especially AI systems), and empirical explorations remain in laboratory settings, overlooking factors that impact trust relations in the real world.Here, we broaden the scope of research by accounting for the supply chains that AI systems are part of.To CHI '25,",
